d398-4a45-b09d-44e8cabffe60","position":{"commit_sha":"ae51a68ba39ce246d07320d3f2e98cf4480d004f","position":"1786086572199285001-5abbf6c5-d398-4a45-b09d-44e8cabffe60"},"signature":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","signer_pubkey":"ssh-ed25519 AAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAIHe3p+OG3L79IIh99qRBEkAEXaU+VbeQcSfhIu4M2F8b rebar-bot joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com"}],"bridge_alerts":[],"claim_harness":"claude-code_2-1-223_agent","claim_remote_session":null,"claimed_session":"6ff494b3-b67f-4284-9d1e-818a0b7eecfd","comments":[],"created_at":1786046856497296001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"75bf4684-77c7-4df2-91a1-9fff78e49561","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"d283-da66-01fc-45e1"},{"link_uuid":"c6e1e2d7-2868-4b08-b240-75f708a1340c","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"e212-4cf7-f7c8-440f"}],"description":"`docs/adr/0004:43-48` asserts the snapshot-entry shape \"has a single source of truth... Both the\nfetcher's output and the differs' expectations target it. When a new field is added to the\nsnapshot, update the schema first.\" Nothing enforces that.\n\n`_engine/rebar_reconciler/_snapshot_schema.py` (228 LOC) is imported by NO production module; the\nintended producer `fetcher.py` never imports it. The originating story declared\n`fetcher.py (producer validates vs schema)` as file impact; that wiring never landed.\n\nThe schema encodes a `parent` present-vs-absent distinction that gates an inbound CLEAR — a\ndata-destroying path whose own history contains a revert titled \"Revert the inbound parent clear:\nit destroys data.\"\n\nRefined during approval: rather than a bespoke contract test, move the contract into\n`src/rebar/schemas/` where ~90 sibling schemas already live, loaded via `schemas.load()` and\nvalidated with `jsonschema` on a `Draft202012Validator`, with a generated TypedDict layer under a\nCI drift gate (`python -m rebar.schemas.gen_types`, `_build-and-test.yml:545`). The snapshot\ncontract is the odd one out — a hand-rolled Python module outside that machinery, which is *why*\nnothing enforces it while 90 siblings are enforced automatically.\n\nReal fetcher output exists for fixtures: `bridge_state/snapshots/` holds 548 files spanning\n2026-06-11..06-29 with fully-populated entries. It is gitignored and contains PII\n(`emailAddress`, `displayName`, `accountId`), so a small redacted fixture must be derived into the\ntracked `tests/fixtures/jira/`, covering all three observed shapes: populated, `parent`-absent,\nand horizon-trimmed-empty.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [x] The snapshot-entry contract lives in `src/rebar/schemas/` and is loadable via `schemas.load()`\n- [x] It is covered by the existing generated-types drift gate rather than a one-off check\n- [x] A redacted fixture in `tests/fixtures/jira/` covers populated, `parent`-absent, and empty shapes\n- [x] A fetcher field change that diverges from the contract fails CI\n- [x] ADR 0004 describes the enforcement that actually exists","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[["parent","b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181"],["relates_to","d283-da66-01fc-45e1"],["relates_to","e212-4cf7-f7c8-440f"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":"b5bc-f4f7-3433-4181","parent_status_uuid":"b033f7fb-7a87-430a-a564-9a3cb5585193","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":1,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":["janitor"],"ticket_id":"8537-78ba-fe3f-42d9","ticket_type":"bug","title":"Enforce the snapshot-entry contract through the schemas drift gate","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["50a365ac-9341-41af-bb91-03ef29877ac2","b033f7fb-7a87-430a-a564-9a3cb5585193","8094a50f-4381-429b-91a1-c7831653a7c0","75bf4684-77c7-4df2-91a1-9fff78e49561","24dce107-d547-4040-bb8b-7ee78ac195ab","c6e1e2d7-2868-4b08-b240-75f708a1340c","5abbf6c5-d398-4a45-b09d-44e8cabffe60"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1786086572199285002,"uuid":"85e30bea-6de6-4773-b641-9bb42f312840"}